          "name": "Shield Explosion",
          "description": "Removes all Sleep wards, Poison Wards and Instant Death Wards from all enemy units on the battlefield.\n\nThen each enemy on the battlefield will randomly either be:\n- granted Cursed Sleep for 200TU.\n- granted Mega Poison for 200TU.\n- immediately defeated (the user is considered to have defeated that enemy with an attack). This will fail if the enemy is a boss or ephemeral. This effect ignores Revenge passive skills, Revival passive skills, and any passive skills or effects of active skills that would prevent the enemy from being defeated.\n\nLocked for 100TU after the user has entered the battlefield. Usable once per battle.\n\nCursed Sleep will overwrite status effects other than Burn, cannot be overwritten by Poison, can be applied repeatedly to units that have already slept while on the battlefield, and will not end from damage caused by Dream Hunter type active skills. Mega Poison will overwrite other status effects on affected enemies. Mega Poison deals 20 times the damage of normal Poison and cannot be overwritten by normal Poison or Super Poison.",
          "selected": "Removes Wards & Grants Random Effect"
