          "description": "When this unit enters battle:\n- all allies are Fortified.\n- this unit will Endure the next damage that would defeat it with 1HP. Endure effects cannot stack.\n- all enemies will be granted Rage Wards. Rage Wards will prevent a unit from becoming Enraged once, then be removed. Rage Wards cannot stack.\n\nAfter this unit's first turn on the battlefield, all allies on the battlefield are healed for 25% of max HP, and Fortified.\n\nIf this unit takes damage from an attack and survives until after the end of the turn, this unit will heal for 1% of max HP."
